  "description": "Read a line-graph intersection and judge the complete demonstration.",
  "source": {
    "authoredBasis": "New authored coordinate graph, not a recovered original. Lines [{\"label\":\"L1\",\"m\":2,\"b\":0},{\"label\":\"L2\",\"m\":-1,\"b\":6}] and shared intersection [2,4]. L1/L2/L3 are neutral labels corresponding in order to the supplied equations, not statements of concurrence. Display does not label the intersection or give its coordinate. A learner recognizes a complete graphical demonstration; independent graph construction remains untested.",
    "authoritativeText": [
      {
        "lesson": "alg6-c3-ex",
        "exercise": "514",
        "text": "在同一坐标系中作出直线 $y-2x=0$ 和 $x+y=6$ 的图象，写出交点的坐标。不作图，确定方程 $2x^3-xy=8$ 的图象是否经过直线的交点。"
      }
    ],
